    "Description": "Copy of an interoffice memo from the Parks and Recreation Director to the City Manager on March 4, 1977. The memo largely discusses the necessary finances for the carousel restoration and some general details of the project. Five people are cc'd, including Mrs. Cy Farley. Blue pen marks bracket a section of the letter about the process of getting the carousel on the Register of National Historic Sites and the unanimous agreement to find funding for the initiation of the carousel restoration. ",
